  "scopeNotes": [
    "This receipt records actual public UI behavior and the displayed exact source values. The original eight mathematical criteria still require their independent implementation, test, source, CI and production evidence.",
    "P7-01,02,05,06,07 selections in this session used pinned archived executions; P7-03 and the initial P7-08 model included both archived and current execution data, and P7-04 used only the fresh explicit-formula record. Current P7-08 universal and rejected claims were separately executed and inspected.",
    "The published archive labels explicitly deny fresh live revalidation, and both source branches preserve their own record/input/field hashes.",
    "Numerical coordinates are per-axis display approximations; extremely narrow rigorous boxes may collapse at display precision. The exact bounds remain in source details and the accessible table.",
    "The re-entered scene remained disposed while below the viewport. It resumed automatically when scrolled into view, without the Reopen button.",
    "The existing root v95 P7-01 through P7-07 current-computation observations and production 25+25 execution acceptance are separate evidence. They are not recounted as fresh v96 runs.",
    "No forced HTTP/worker failure was injected in this public session; the earlier mounted tests cover the promise rejection path.",
    "Initial screenshots with incomplete framing are retained as raw attempts and are not the sole acceptance evidence.",
    "Four browser-to-shared-files writes were absent after the initial save. Their already observed in-memory raw values and screenshot bytes were saved again as *-copy files without recomputing or changing the observation."
